0result.sql is correct because  
1. It filters to delivered orders only (cancellation IS NULL).  
2. It calculates the base price once per pizza (grouped per order) so multiple pizzas in the same order are counted correctly.  
3. It aggregates extra‑topping charges once per order, preventing the extras from being multiplied by the number of pizzas when an order contains more than one pizza.  
4. Finally, it adds the two components and sums across all delivered orders, giving the accurate total income of $144.